    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are there ever <i>enough</i> pockets in your life?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever fallen in love with a dress, only to realize, heartbreakingly, that it has <i>no</i> pockets?<br>Remember those pants with pockets so tiny, they couldn\u2019t hold anything, not even a hair tie?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yeah. We\u2019ve all been there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the place to talk about <strong>POCKETS</strong>, and why we still don't have them.<br><br>&quot;Where Is My Pocket?&quot; is an interactive story that humorously explores the strange and surprisingly unfair world of pocket inequality.\u00a0Through playful narration, quirky characters, and colorful voxel art, the game invites you to laugh, learn, and maybe even question your wardrobe choices along the way.<br>  Perfect gift for anyone who want more pockets in their life.<br><br><strong>Key</strong>\u00a0<strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of the game is The Interviews, where you\u2019ll meet a cast of fictional characters, each with their own take on pocket injustice. Around it are four bite-sized side games:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Pocketless Adventure</strong>: Test your survival skills in a world with zero pockets.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Pocket Test</strong>:  Find out what kind of pocket you'd have in an alternate universe.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Random Pockets</strong>: Discover the contents of 10 mysterious pockets.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Pocket Tutorial</strong>: Learn how to sew a realistic, functional pocket.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the <strong>secret story of Spiny</strong> the Spider</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Share your opinion</strong> in the optional end-game Pocket Survey, your voice might appear in future updates!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
